entries[188847] = { ["name"] = "Headpiece of the Fixed Stars", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHead Leather\n78 Armor\n+69 [Agility or Intellect]\n+104 Stamina\n+ 79 Versatility\n+ 59 Mastery\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Druid\nTapestry of the Fixed Stars (0/5)\nHandwraps of the Fixed Stars\nShoulderpads of the Fixed Stars\nChestguard of the Fixed Stars\nLeggings of the Fixed Stars\nHeadpiece of the Fixed Stars\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Balance: Entering Lunar Eclipse creates a Fury of Elune at 20% effectiveness that follows your current target for 8 sec.\n(2) Set Feral: Each combo point spent reduces the cooldown of [ Incarnation: Avatar of Ashamane : Incarnation: King of the Jungle / Berserk] by 0.7 sec.\n(2) Set Guardian: Casting Barkskin causes you to Berserk for 4 sec.\n(2) Set Restoration: Healing from Rejuvenation has a 25% chance to grant Renewing Bloom, healing (20.8% of Spell Power) over 8 sec. Swiftmend can consume Renewing Bloom. (Proc chance: 25%)\n(4) Set Balance: While in an Eclipse, the cost of Starsurge and Starfall is reduced by 15%.\n(4) Set Feral: Entering Berserk causes you to strike all nearby enemies, dealing (400.25% of Attack Power) Bleed damage over 10 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets.\n(4) Set Guardian: While Berserked, you radiate (17.29% of Attack Power) Cosmic damage to nearby enemies and heal yourself for (25.805% of Attack Power) every 1 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n(4) Set Restoration: Every 3 casts of Swiftmend grants you Incarnation: Tree of Life for 9 sec.\nSell Price:" }
