entries[188863] = { ["name"] = "Gauntlets of the First Eidolon", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHands Plate\n129 Armor\n+52 [Strength or Intellect]\n+78 Stamina\n+ 30 Critical Strike\n+ 74 Mastery\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Death Knight\nThe First Eidolon's Soulsteel (0/5)\nVisage of the First Eidolon\nShoulderplates of the First Eidolon\nChausses of the First Eidolon\nCarapace of the First Eidolon\nGauntlets of the First Eidolon\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Blood: While your Dancing Rune Weapon is active Heart Strike extends the duration of Dancing Rune Weapon by 0.5 seconds and increases your Strength by 1%, persisting for 10 seconds after Dancing Rune Weapon ends. (500ms cooldown)\n(2) Set Frost: Remorseless Winter grants 8% Critical Strike while active.\n(2) Set Unholy: Every 5 [ Clawing Shadows / Scourge Strikes] that burst Festering Wounds applies Soul Reaper on your target and summons an Army of the Dead ghoul for 15 seconds. (750ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Blood: When you take damage, you have a chance equal to 100% of your Parry chance to lash out, Heart Striking your attacker. Dancing Rune Weapon now summons 2 Rune Weapons. (3s cooldown)\n(4) Set Frost: Consuming Killing Machine fires a Glacial Advance through your target.\n(4) Set Unholy: Your minions deal 10% increased damage. When Soul Reaper's secondary effect triggers, this bonus increases to 50% for 8 seconds. (750ms cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
