entries[188875] = { ["name"] = "Habit of the Empyrean", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n60 Armor\n+69 Intellect\n+104 Stamina\n+ 97 Critical Strike\n+ 42 Haste\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Priest\nHabiliments of the Empyrean (0/5)\nCaress of the Empyrean\nAmice of the Empyrean\nCapelet of the Empyrean\nLeggings of the Empyrean\nHabit of the Empyrean\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Discipline: Casting Power Word: Shield or Shadow Mend has a 15% chance to make your next cast of Shadow Mend have no cost or cast time. (Proc chance: 15%)\n(2) Set Holy: Your Holy Words begin Divine Conversation, increasing the cooldown reduction of your next Holy-Word-affecting spell by 15 sec.\n(2) Set Shadow: Casting Devouring Plague has a 40% chance to grant Dark Thought. Casting Searing Nightmare has a 25% chance to grant Dark Thought.\n(4) Set Discipline: Power of the Dark Side increases the effectiveness of Penance by an additional 45% and is triggered when Power Word: Radiance is cast.\n(4) Set Holy: Divine Conversation increases the effectiveness of your next Holy-Word-affecting spell by 60%.\n(4) Set Shadow: Consuming a Dark Thought causes your shadow to animate after a moment, dealing [(20.9% of Spell Power) * 6] Shadow damage over 6 sec to all enemies within 10 yards of your target.\nSell Price:" }
