entries[188884] = { ["name"] = "Robes of the Demon Star", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n60 Armor\n+69 Intellect\n+104 Stamina\n+ 97 Haste\n+ 42 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Warlock\nShroud of the Demon Star (0/5)\nGrasps of the Demon Star\nHorns of the Demon Star\nMantle of the Demon Star\nLeggings of the Demon Star\nRobes of the Demon Star\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Affliction: Malefic Rapture's damage is increased by 25% and each cast extends the duration of Corruption, Agony, and Unstable Affliction by 2 sec.\n(2) Set Demonology: Call Dreadstalkers has a 100% chance to summon an additional Dreadstalker.\n(2) Set Destruction: Every 10 Soul Shards spent grants Ritual of Ruin, making your next Chaos Bolt or Rain of Fire consume no Soul Shards and have no cast time.\n(4) Set Affliction: While Agony, Corruption, and Unstable Affliction are active, your [ Drain Soul : Drain Soul has a 20% chance / Shadow Bolt has a 30% chance] to make your next Malefic Rapture cost no Soul Shards and cast instantly.\n(4) Set Demonology: Your Hand of Gul'dan has a 15% chance per Soul Shard to summon a Malicious Imp. When slain, Malicious Imp will either deal (85% of Spell Power) Fire damage to all nearby enemies of your Implosion or deal it to your current target.\n(4) Set Destruction: When Chaos Bolt or Rain of Fire consumes a charge of Ritual of Ruin, you summon a Blasphemy for 8 sec.\nSell Price:" }
