entries[188928] = { ["name"] = "Luminous Chevalier's Gauntlets", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHands Plate\n129 Armor\n+52 [Strength or Intellect]\n+78 Stamina\n+ 30 Haste\n+ 74 Mastery\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Paladin\nLuminous Chevalier's Gallantry (0/5)\nLuminous Chevalier's Casque\nLuminous Chevalier's Epaulets\nLuminous Chevalier's Robes\nLuminous Chevalier's Plackart\nLuminous Chevalier's Gauntlets\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Holy: Casting Word of Glory causes your next Light of Dawn to heal for 50% more and cast twice. Cannot occur more often than once per 30 sec.\n(2) Set Protection: Casting Shield of the Righteous increases your Block chance by 4% for 15 sec, stacking up to 3 times.\n(2) Set Retribution: When you benefit from Art of War, you gain Seraphim for 4 sec.\n(4) Set Holy: Each target hit by Light of Dawn has a 50% chance to reduce the remaining cooldown of Avenging Wrath by 2 sec.\n(4) Set Protection: When you take damage, you have a chance equal to 100% of your Block chance to cast Judgment at your attacker. (3s cooldown)\n(4) Set Retribution: Art of War has a 50% chance to reset the cooldown of Wake of Ashes instead of Blade of Justice.\nSell Price:" }
