entries[188937] = { ["name"] = "Grasps of the Infinite Infantry", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nHands Plate\n129 Armor\n+52 [Strength or Intellect]\n+78 Stamina\n+ 30 Critical Strike\n+ 74 Mastery\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Warrior\nArmaments of the Infinite Infantry (0/5)\nGaze of the Infinite Infantry\nPauldrons of the Infinite Infantry\nLegplates of the Infinite Infantry\nBreastplate of the Infinite Infantry\nGrasps of the Infinite Infantry\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Arms: [ Warbreaker / Colossus Smash] lasts 3 sec longer and increases your damage dealt to affected enemies by an additional 5%.\n(2) Set Fury: Raging Blow deals 10% increased damage and gains an additional charge.\n(2) Set Protection: Consuming 30 rage grants a stack of Seeing Red, which transforms at 8 stacks into Outburst, causing your next Shield Slam or Thunder Clap to be 200% more effective and grant Ignore Pain.\n(4) Set Arms: Tactician has a 50% increased chance to proc against enemies with Colossus Smash and causes your next Overpower to grant 2% Strength, up to 8% for 15 sec.\n(4) Set Fury: Raging Blow has a 20% chance to grant Recklessness for 3 sec. (750ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Protection: Avatar increases your damage dealt by an additional 10% and decreases damage taken by 10%. Avatar instantly grants Outburst.\nSell Price:" }
